{"schema_version":"genshin-world-lore-card-v1","lore_id":"nodkrai_geography","name_zh":"挪德卡莱主要区域","name_en":"Major Areas of Nod-Krai","aliases":["挪德卡莱主要区域","Major Areas of Nod-Krai"],"category":"geography","scope":"regional","regions":["Nod-Krai"],"summary":"挪德卡莱的主体区域清单包含七处区域：烟硌山峰、Dunanna Pit、希汐岛、伦波岛、帕哈岛、虚海望与逐浪野。另有隶属于挪德卡莱的Frost Moon子区域，下辖Dark Side of the Moon、Lunar Highlands与Moontide Sea三处区域。各地分别呈现古林岛屿、港镇与机械工坊、月石坠落地、深渊活动山区、沼泽与灯塔城市、古塔湖区，以及月面遗迹和高浓度古月能量海等地貌与聚落特征。","canonical_facts":[{"fact_id":"nodkrai_geography_fact_01","text":"挪德卡莱的七处主体区域为烟硌山峰（Ashveil Peak）、Dunanna Pit、希汐岛（Hiisi Island）、伦波岛（Lempo Isle）、帕哈岛（Paha Isle）、虚海望（Voidsea Outlook）与逐浪野（Wavechaser Plain）。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现行区域划分","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_02","fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_03","fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_05","fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_06","fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_07","fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_08","fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_09","fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_10"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_geography_fact_02","text":"Frost Moon是隶属于挪德卡莱的子区域，下辖Dark Side of the Moon、Lunar Highlands与Moontide Sea三处区域。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现行区域划分","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_02","fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_03","fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_04"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_geography_fact_03","text":"希汐岛属于Southern Isles，是「霜月之子」的家园；在他们的守护下，岛上大部分地区仍是未受扰动的荒野。其主要子区域包括Frostmoon Enclave、Light-Bathed Platform与Silvermoon Hall。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_05","local_sup_nodkrai_geography_01"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_geography_fact_04","text":"伦波岛属于Southern Isles。岛上的那夏镇是挪德卡莱的主要港口与商业中心；该岛还分布着Blue Amber Lake、机械工坊、山间通道、荒原与海滩等子区域。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_04","fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_06"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_geography_fact_05","text":"帕哈岛属于Southern Isles，现为「愚人众」人员在挪德卡莱的活动基地之一，Kuuvahki Experimental Design Bureau设于此地。该岛原本以落日色盐沼和群生的特殊生命为主要景观，最重的坠落月石碎片撞上岛岸后，其状态由此改变。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"月石坠落后至当前","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_07","local_sup_nodkrai_geography_01"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_geography_fact_06","text":"烟硌山峰属于Pohjola。Cliffwatch Camp负责监视Kipumaki Cliff一带的深渊活动，而Kipumaki Cliff是挪德卡莱北部Wild Hunt活动密集之地；区域内还包括Special Territory Research Institute等地点。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_08"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_geography_fact_07","text":"虚海望位于Pohjola南端、帕哈岛以北，下辖雾气笼罩的Dreadshade Mire和建于古老城堡之上的城市Piramida；Piramida是Lightkeepers的总部。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_09","fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_04"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_geography_fact_08","text":"逐浪野属于Pohjola，Pillar of Embla、Favonius Keep与Amsvartnir湖均位于此地。其子区域还包括位于西侧的屏障岛群Wing of Keres。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_10"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_geography_fact_09","text":"Dunanna Pit被列为挪德卡莱的主要区域之一，其子区域包括Dunanna Forward Station与Misty Shoal；当地一座无人且被迷雾笼罩的岛上留有旧文明痕迹。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_01","fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_02"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_geography_fact_10","text":"Frost Moon具有独特的月面环境：Dark Side of the Moon矗立着寂静的黑色要塞；Lunar Highlands分布着古老遗迹、研究设施和生态空间；Moontide Sea则是在一场严重灾变后形成、充盈高浓度Archaeolune Energy的月海。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"灾变后至当前","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_01","fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_04"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_geography_fact_11","text":"据菈乌玛所述，数月前坠落的两块最大「古月遗骸」分别落在希汐岛和帕哈岛；「愚人众」随后在帕哈岛的陨石上建立了试验设计局，并觊觎希汐岛的另一块遗骸。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"数月前至当前","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["local_sup_nodkrai_geography_01","local_sup_nodkrai_geography_02"]}],"timeline":[{"period":"约五百年前至今","order_hint":1,"events":["Pillar of Embla的存在在过去五百年间持续对逐浪野周边环境造成不可逆变化。","约五百年前，Scourge of Endless Decay首次遭放逐后被封印在烟硌山峰的Kipumaki Cliff；该地现仍是Wild Hunt活动密集区域。"],"current_status":"Pillar of Embla仍位于逐浪野；Kipumaki Cliff仍受到监视，并保持深渊与Wild Hunt活动热点的地理状态。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_04","fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_08","fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_10"]},{"period":"主线故事开始前数月","order_hint":2,"events":["据菈乌玛所述，两块最大的「古月遗骸」自高天坠落，分别落在希汐岛和帕哈岛。","帕哈岛因重大的月石碎片撞击而由原本普通的盐沼岛屿转变；「愚人众」在当地陨石上建立了试验设计局。"],"current_status":"坠落遗骸继续影响两岛的地理与势力分布，帕哈岛目前仍是「愚人众」的重要活动地点。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_07","local_sup_nodkrai_geography_01","local_sup_nodkrai_geography_02"]}],"relationships":[],"in_world_visibility":{"public_summary":"挪德卡莱居民与往来商旅通常能够辨识七处主体区域及其主要聚落；Frost Moon三处月面区域、Dunanna Pit旧文明遗迹和各地异常能量环境的详细资料，更可能掌握在当地组织、研究者或亲历者手中。","likely_known_by":["挪德卡莱常住居民与商旅","「霜月之子」","「愚人众」驻挪德卡莱人员","Lightkeepers成员","驻扎于Favonius Keep的西风骑士团人员","研究Frost Moon或月矩力的学者"],"unlikely_known_by":["远离挪德卡莱且未曾到访的普通居民","不了解月面研究与当地历史的人","未接触相关遗迹、机构或亲历者的人"],"common_beliefs_or_misconceptions":["挪德卡莱具有「乐园」之名，但这不表示各区域都安全或秩序稳定；例如那夏镇兼具自由港与无法地带的特征，北部也有深渊活动热点。","Frost Moon的三处区域属于挪德卡莱新增的子区域体系，不应与七处主体区域混为同一份七区域清单。"]},"activation_keys":["挪德卡莱主要区域","Major Areas of Nod-Krai"],"excluded_material":{"gameplay_only":["观景点数量、解锁条件、任务步骤要求与地图图片位置","神像开图、探索度、传送锚点、秘境、首领与远征等地图系统信息","角色生命值、战斗状态、元素反应、护盾、按键、机关解谜与移动机制","宝箱、月印、奖励、掉落物、特产及培养相关内容","任务、原声曲目、活动玩法、烹饪计时和可交互物操作说明"],"unsupported_or_speculative":["未将地名词源及现实神话、天体命名的相似性解释为提瓦特世界内的地名起源。","未将观景点描述中的预言、象征性修辞或传说性表述直接升级为已确认的客观地理事实。","未凭英文名称猜测Dunanna Pit、Frost Moon及其三处区域的中文正式名。"]},"sources":[{"source_id":"fandom_nodkrai_geography","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Viewpoint/Nod-Krai","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Viewpoint/Nod-Krai","language":"en","revision_id":"2073694","source_text_sha256":"bd1fe8003651870bfcfa5e361ef328292d0f4cf4e1464c37247b2ca1c6143dfc"},{"source_id":"bwiki_nodkrai_geography","provider":"bwiki","role":"cross_language_verification","title":"地理志挪德卡莱","url":"https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/%E5%9C%B0%E7%90%86%E5%BF%97%E6%8C%AA%E5%BE%B7%E5%8D%A1%E8%8E%B1","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"670327","source_text_sha256":"2d6b038b48431a6239db044c2021c7635d8e8522219c6f8ea305618a54df472b"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_01","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Viewpoint/Nod-Krai","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Viewpoint/Nod-Krai","language":"en","revision_id":"2073694","source_text_sha256":"7a7647c5462ea577f0496a562f4f04f59a5301d1ab50490eb9a6b56170eae8b2"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_02","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Nod-Krai","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Nod-Krai","language":"en","revision_id":"2136063","source_text_sha256":"2bb0362a6a40612cec624f16100d283e8799c4eb3de8ae9f5d735e45af0e3625"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_03","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Area","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Area","language":"en","revision_id":"2122021","source_text_sha256":"d3502e643c8305293f1ac763938f7c9f606e46bee2b93ec1be1ec09a29c35705"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_04","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Loading Screen/Nod-Krai","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Loading_Screen/Nod-Krai","language":"en","revision_id":"2122906","source_text_sha256":"d892974456370cc4d3c8023079bfe148ac548a0fd25ba728058afcd9ebc6f0b0"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_05","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Hiisi Island","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Hiisi_Island","language":"en","revision_id":"2105767","source_text_sha256":"bba5859138ddd6485e4ed8820a11a63fa3b6b175ff22e0605dcf7882e9e050d2"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_06","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Lempo Isle","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Lempo_Isle","language":"en","revision_id":"2078870","source_text_sha256":"0aaf29de1fef380f276aaed86db31c506f6d44eccc6b61890db366fb62c5c0de"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_07","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Paha Isle","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Paha_Isle","language":"en","revision_id":"2105768","source_text_sha256":"297573ad600ae59facd88ee38c6d68c69ca536d3b329912091bbdc1f30c22a4e"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_08","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Ashveil Peak","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Ashveil_Peak","language":"en","revision_id":"2105770","source_text_sha256":"4b54c33e4edebf05bab3e2ec8bba969063fe272da84db32ced911ea092faac00"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_09","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Voidsea Outlook","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Voidsea_Outlook","language":"en","revision_id":"2116754","source_text_sha256":"8870db6f10cc58c63d9985a82bbe977e3a352a08adcf2b99dfde926d1c80759e"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_nodkrai_geography_10","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Wavechaser Plain","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Wavechaser_Plain","language":"en","revision_id":"2105771","source_text_sha256":"7cada4f6b486c3d88e5e8172850822b0386ead14b0bfabb895f96700f09857f5"},{"source_id":"local_sup_nodkrai_geography_01","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"月亮升起的地方","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_6000.json#unit=600023","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"200017acc847c30e1567ffd9ac59b74c3b752666357a90019f410b9bc5b10c59"},{"source_id":"local_sup_nodkrai_geography_02","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"月亮升起的地方","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_6000.json#unit=600029","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"997ae03ff7aab67f9f84b051d0fb54ec5850cbd7445fad79e5354e1dc96231a6"}],"evidence_bundle_sha256":"f211a33d82e149a2482ad231b3b7c890d4dbfe96d84841a7f0e938793b36519c","review":{"cross_language_conflicts":[],"uncertain_claims":["希汐岛与帕哈岛分别承接两块最大「古月遗骸」及希汐岛遗骸遭觊觎的内容来自菈乌玛的游戏内陈述，故保留为reported；帕哈岛遭月石碎片撞击并由此改变另有Fandom区域正文支持。"],"missing_evidence":["证据包未明确给出Dunanna Pit、Frost Moon、Dark Side of the Moon、Lunar Highlands与Moontide Sea的中文正式区域名。","Dunanna Pit缺少独立区域正文；现有材料只能确认其区域地位、两个子区域及少量观景点描述。"],"needs_human_review":true}}